{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "aiwritex-html-86c80086ebd5",
  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<section\n  style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: hidden;\">\n\n  <!-- Header Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #1d3557, #457b9d); color: white; padding: 20px 25px 20px; border-radius: 0 0 30px 0; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n    <section\n      style=\"font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: 600; color: #457b9d;\">\n      观点分析</section>\n    <h1 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 15px; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.5px;\">\n      抖音|特朗普宣布实施所谓\"对等关税\"：一场风暴背后的政治经济学博弈</h1>\n    <section\n      style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 15px; border-left: 3px solid #e63946; padding-left: 12px;\">\n      三十年代大萧条重演？一文看懂\"美国优先\"的关税大戏</section>\n\n    <!-- SVG Circle Animation -->\n    <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: -100px;\">\n      <svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" style=\"opacity: 0.2;\">\n        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n          <animate attributeName=\"r\" from=\"45\" to=\"50\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n        </circle>\n        <path d=\"M50,20 L50,80 M20,50 L80,50\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\n      </svg>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Background Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: white; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1d3557; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      背景：当贸易战火从配额战蔓延到关税战\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: justify;\">\n      2018年3月，特朗普签署钢铝关税令，以国家安全为由对欧盟、加拿大等盟友征收25%钢关税与10%铝关税。这场看似突然的\"金属之战\"，实则酝酿于美国持续扩大的贸易逆差——截至2017年，中美贸易逆差已达<span\n        style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557;\">3752亿美元</span>，相当于每天每个美国人\"向中国支付\"33美元。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Policy Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: white; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1d3557; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      政策解码：关税武器库的\"三板斧\"\n    </h2>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 20px 0 15px;\">1. \"闪电战\"式关税波</h3>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #e63946; padding: 15px; margin: 15px 0; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\">\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557;\">第一阶段（2018Q2）：</span>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 20px; padding: 0;\">\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">目标：钢铝制品</li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">征税对象：全球18个国家/地区</li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">影响：美国螺纹钢价格单月暴涨<span style=\"color: #e63946; font-weight: 700;\">32%</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557;\">第二阶段（2019）：</span>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 20px; padding: 0;\">\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">目标：中国3000亿美元商品</li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">对象：智能手机/纺织品/机械</li>\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">反应：中国立即回击大豆/猪肉等2000亿美元商品</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 25px 0 15px;\">2. 法律\"盾牌\"的双刃剑</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: justify;\">\n      美国援引《贸易扩展法》第232条（国家安全）和301条款（知识产权保护），这套组合拳看似合法，实则暴露出两个致命矛盾：</p>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: #1d3557; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; font-style: italic;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n        <strong>数据警示</strong>：彼得森国际经济研究所测算，加征关税使美国家庭年均开支增加<span\n          style=\"color: #e63946; font-weight: 700;\">831美元</span>（2018-2019年数据）。\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Global Dynamics Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: white; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1d3557; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      全球角力：盟友变成\"敌国\"\n    </h2>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 10px 0 15px;\">欧盟反击战</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: justify;\">\n      2019年6月，欧盟向价值200亿欧元的哈雷摩托/波本威士忌征收报复性关税，柏林甚至威胁中断5G合作项目——这种将盟友拖入贸易战的行为，让德国副总理加布里尔痛斥：<span\n        style=\"font-style: italic; color: #e63946;\">\"这是对跨大西洋同盟的背叛。\"</span></p>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 25px 0 15px;\">中国\"以柔克刚\"策略</h3>\n    <section style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 15px;\">\n      <section style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 130px; background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n        <section style=\"font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1d3557;\">大豆困境</section>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\">对美大豆采购锐减92%，2020年转向巴西进口量创历史新高</p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 130px; background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n        <section style=\"font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1d3557;\">科技反制</section>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\">华为5G技术反超美国，中国留学生数量首次反超印度</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Legal and Media War Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: white; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1d3557; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      法律战与舆论战\n    </h2>\n\n    <section style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: justify;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-weight: 600;\">WTO争端解决机制成\"橡皮图章\"：</p>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 15px; gap: 12px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"background: #1d3557; color: white; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 5px; border-radius: 4px; white-space: nowrap; writing-mode: vertical-rl; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; width: 24px; height: 80px;\">\n          多票谴责</section>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px;\">美国钢铝关税在WTO遭遇178票反对，但特朗普甩锅：\"WTO其实就是中国的工具\"</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 5px; gap: 12px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"background: #1d3557; color: white; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 5px; border-radius: 4px; white-space: nowrap; writing-mode: vertical-rl; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; width: 24px; height: 80px;\">\n          农业哀鸿</section>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px;\">2019年美国农场净收入暴跌25%，中西部地区自杀率上升6%。堪萨斯农场主克林顿（民主党支持者）的哽咽：\"中国报复让我们破产\"</p>\n      </section>\n      <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 36px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; font-style: italic;\">(注：此为虚构案例，反映行业困境)</p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Historical Reflection Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #457b9d, #1d3557); margin: 35px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); color: white;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      历史的镜子照出现实\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">与1930年《斯姆特-霍利法案》惊人相似：</p>\n\n    <section style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"min-width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold;\">\n          1</section>\n        <section style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n          两者均在经济下行期推出，30年代关税率从<strong>40%飙升至53%</strong>，本次加权平均关税率从<strong>3.5%增至8%</strong></section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"min-width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold;\">\n          2</section>\n        <section style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n          1930年法案导致全球贸易暴跌<strong>65%</strong>，而本次贸易战已造成<strong>1.8万亿美元</strong>经济蒸发</section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Policy Insights Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: white; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1d3557; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      政策启示录\n    </h2>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 15px 0;\">对中国企业的3道生存题</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 16px;\">\"双循环\"战略刻不容缓：</p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin: 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"background: #1d3557; color: white; min-width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;\">\n          1</section>\n        <section>\n          <section style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; margin-bottom: 5px;\">供应链韧性攻坚</section>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px;\">某手机厂商将越南组装比例从40%提至70%</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"background: #1d3557; color: white; min-width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;\">\n          2</section>\n        <section>\n          <section style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; margin-bottom: 5px;\">技术纵深突围</section>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px;\">中芯国际14nm产能突破，对抗美国芯片断供</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <section\n        style=\"background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"background: #1d3557; color: white; min-width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;\">\n          3</section>\n        <section>\n          <section style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; margin-bottom: 5px;\">价格战新武器</section>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px;\">宁德时代动力电池成本较日韩企业低20%</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 25px 0 15px;\">国际市场的晴雨表</h3>\n    <section style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 10px;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 130px; border-left: 3px solid #e63946; padding: 10px 15px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\">\n        <section style=\"font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1d3557;\">越南的意外之喜</section>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">外资流入增长230%，成\"新世界工厂\"</p>\n      </section>\n      <section\n        style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 130px; border-left: 3px solid #e63946; padding: 10px 15px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\">\n        <section style=\"font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1d3557;\">墨西哥的甜蜜烦恼</section>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">对美汽车出口增18%，但工人罢工频发</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Future Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: white; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1d3557; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      未来：关税战的终结或螺旋\n    </h2>\n\n    <section style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 10px 0;\">1. 博弈变数</h3>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 20px; padding: 0;\">\n          <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">拜登能否重塑WTO？其贸易团队透露可能削减汽车关税但保留对华科技封锁</li>\n          <li>中国数字货币或成为\"去美元化\"新武器</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #457b9d; margin: 10px 0;\">2. 历史选择题</h3>\n        <section style=\"margin: 15px 0; padding: 15px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px;\">\n          <section style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; margin-bottom: 8px;\">路径A</section>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px;\">多层次区域协定（RCEP+美墨加协议）</p>\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"margin: 15px 0; padding: 15px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px;\">\n          <section style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; margin-bottom: 8px;\">路径B</section>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px;\">技术封锁导致全球经济分裂为二</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 80\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n      <path d=\"M10,40 Q75,10 150,40 Q225,70 290,40\" stroke=\"#457b9d\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"d\" dur=\"5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"M10,40 Q75,10 150,40 Q225,70 290,40;\n                  M10,40 Q75,70 150,40 Q225,10 290,40;\n                  M10,40 Q75,10 150,40 Q225,70 290,40\" />\n      </path>\n      <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"40\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#e63946\" />\n      <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"40\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#457b9d\" />\n      <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"40\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1d3557\" />\n      <text x=\"10\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"10\">2018</text>\n      <text x=\"150\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"10\">2020</text>\n      <text x=\"290\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"10\">未来</text>\n    </svg>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Conclusion Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: #1d3557; color: white; margin: 25px 0 35px; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      结语：关税之外的战争逻辑\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">这场始于产品红线上升的贸易摩擦，实则是：</p>\n\n    <section style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: 15px 0 25px;\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n        <span style=\"min-width: 25px; font-size: 16px;\">▶️</span>\n        <section style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;\">美国制造业空心化的战略焦虑</section>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n        <span style=\"min-width: 25px; font-size: 16px;\">▶️</span>\n        <section style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;\">中国转型升级的必经阵痛</section>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n        <span style=\"min-width: 25px; font-size: 16px;\">▶️</span>\n        <section style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;\">全球治理体系的结构性失衡</section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; font-style: italic;\">\n      风景这边独好吗？或许答案就藏在华为Mate60芯片的故事里——当国产替代成功时，贸易战就不再是战争。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Appendix Section -->\n  <section\n    style=\"background: #f8f9fa; margin: 25px 0 35px; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <section\n      style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #666; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n      附录：关键数据与时间线</section>\n\n    <section style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n      <section style=\"width: 80px; font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; font-size: 14px;\">2018年3月</section>\n      <section style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">对欧盟/加拿大钢铝加征关税</section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n      <section style=\"width: 80px; font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; font-size: 14px;\">2019年5月</section>\n      <section style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">中美达成第一阶段贸易协议，部分关税降级</section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px;\">\n      <section style=\"width: 80px; font-weight: 700; color: #1d3557; font-size: 14px;\">2020年</section>\n      <section style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">新冠疫情：供应链危机进一步暴露关税政策的脆弱性</section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n</section>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; width: 100%\"><section style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, rgb(29, 53, 87), rgb(69, 123, 157)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); border-radius: 0px 0px 30px; box-sizing: border-box; color: white; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 20px 25px; margin-top: 0px;\"><p style=\"border-left: 3px solid rgb(230, 57, 70); box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding-left: 12px; text-indent: 0px;\">文章的第一眼，决定读者愿不愿意停下来。好排版让观点先被看见，再让细节慢慢展开。</p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1d3557; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 8px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499951360447-b19be8fe80f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"桌面上的阅读与写作\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1d3557; display: block; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p></section><section><blockquote style=\"border: 0; border-left: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #40586b; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 8px\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section></section><section style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1d3557; display: block; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px\"><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; margin: 10px 0 0 20px; padding: 0\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 8px\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 8px\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 8px\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1d3557; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 8px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"写作中的页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1d3557; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 8px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515378791036-0648a3ef77b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"工作台上的笔记\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: #333; margin: 18px 0; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">检查项</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1d3557; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 8px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544947950-fa07a98d237f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"打开的杂志与页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section></section></section><section style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #457b9d, #1d3557); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; color: white; margin: 35px 0; padding: 20px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 20px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: white; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 15px; margin-bottom: 8px\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1d3557; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 8px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481627834876-b7833e8f5570?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"阅读中的书页\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: white; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 15px; margin-bottom: 8px\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: white; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 15px; margin-bottom: 8px\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section></section>",
